NovouxDescription=Companion module for the Novo theme — palette selection and brand overrides
NovouxDescriptionLong=Provides an admin interface to configure the Novo theme: select color palettes, override the primary brand color, and set a custom logo.
ModuleNovouxName=Novo UX
ModuleNovouxDesc=Companion module for the Novo theme
