NovouxPaletteHelp=Select the color palette for the Novo theme. Changes apply to all users immediately.
NovouxPrimaryColorHelp=Override the primary brand color (hex format, e.g. #3b82f6). Leave empty to use palette default.
NovouxAccentColorHelp=Override the accent/highlight color (hex). Leave empty to use palette default.
NovouxDangerColorHelp=Override the danger/error color (hex). Leave empty to use palette default.
NovouxLogoUrlHelp=URL to a client logo image. Leave empty to use the Dolibarr default logo.
NovouxDensity=Display Density
NovouxDensityHelp=Controls spacing, row height, and font size. Compact shows more data, Spacious is easier to scan.
NovouxRadius=Border Radius Style
NovouxRadiusHelp=Controls the roundness of cards, buttons, and inputs across the theme.
NovouxDarkMode=Dark Mode
NovouxDarkModeHelp=Controls how dark mode is applied. Toggle adds a button in the top bar for users to switch.
NovouxDarkDisabled=Disabled (always light)
NovouxDarkAuto=Auto (follow OS preference)
NovouxDarkToggle=User toggle (button in top bar)
NovouxDarkForced=Force dark
NovouxCustomCss=Custom CSS
NovouxCustomCssHelp=Custom CSS rules appended after all theme styles. Max 4 KB. Use to fine-tune without editing files.
NovouxCustomCssTruncated=Custom CSS was truncated to 4 KB limit.
ErrorBadColor=Invalid color format. Use hex format like #3b82f6
NovouxThemePrefs=Theme
NovouxUserPrefs=Theme Preferences
NovouxUserPrefsInfo=Users can override the admin defaults from their User card → Theme tab.
ResetToDefault=Reset to Default
ErrorBadUrl=Invalid URL format
NovouxSidebarCollapse=Collapsible Sidebar
NovouxSidebarCollapseHelp=Allow users to collapse the left menu to a narrow icon rail. Requires theme JS enabled.
